#MOBILE
Vnum       40701
Keywords   naro master temple~
Short      Naro~
Long       Naro checks a patient's bandages with quiet, careful hands.
~
Desc       Naro, joint Master of Mahara Kesh, has the unhurried manner of
someone who has never once been surprised by an injury. Alongside
Calleh, he has led the Temple's healers for longer than most
initiates have been alive.
~
