#MOBILE
Vnum       40702
Keywords   calleh master temple~
Short      Calleh~
Long       Calleh moves between beds in the recovery ward, checking on each patient in turn.
~
Desc       Calleh, joint Master of Mahara Kesh alongside Naro, is known
for a bedside manner as gentle as her diagnoses are blunt. Initiates
learn quickly that she will always tell them exactly how badly they
have hurt themselves this time.
~
Race       Human~
Position   standing~
DefPos     standing~
Gender     female~
