#ROOM
Vnum     40701
Name     Mahara Kesh Surface Platform~
Sector   water swim~
Flags    can_land~
Desc     A broad, gently rocking platform floats here, anchored far
below in the depths of Tython's deep ocean. Waves lap steadily at its
edges, and a wide shaft descends from its center down into the dark
water beneath.
~
#EXIT
Direction down~
ToRoom    40702
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    40949
#ENDEXIT
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40702
Name     Descent Shaft~
Sector   underwater~
Flags    ~
Desc     A long, pressure-sealed shaft carries you down through cold,
increasingly dark water, faint bioluminescent markers guiding the way
toward Mahara Kesh below. The surface light fades quickly overhead.
~
#EXIT
Direction up~
ToRoom    40701
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction down~
ToRoom    40703
#ENDEXIT
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40703
Name     Gate of Mahara Kesh~
Sector   underwater~
Flags    ~
Desc     Mahara Kesh's gate opens directly onto the ocean floor, its
entrance ringed with softly glowing coral cultivated by generations of
healers. The pressure here is held back by walls grown as much as
built.
~
#EXIT
Direction up~
ToRoom    40702
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    40704
#ENDEXIT
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40704
Name     Great Healing Hall~
Sector   underwater~
Flags    ~
Desc     Soft bioluminescent light pulses gently along the walls of this
wide, curved hall, timed - initiates are told - to match a resting
heartbeat. Healers move calmly between patients here, unhurried even
in urgency.
~
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    40703
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    40707
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction east~
ToRoom    40705
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction west~
ToRoom    40706
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 40703 1 40704
Reset O 0 40701 4 40704
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40705
Name     Herbal Ward~
Sector   underwater~
Flags    ~
Desc     Racks of sea-herbs and reagents fill this ward, sorted by
property rather than species. A faint, not unpleasant medicinal smell
hangs in the water-filtered air.
~
#EXIT
Direction west~
ToRoom    40704
#ENDEXIT

Reset O 0 40702 4 40705
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40706
Name     Recovery Ward~
Sector   underwater~
Flags    ~
Desc     Rows of simple beds fill this quiet ward, most occupied by
initiates nursing training injuries rather than anything more serious.
The bioluminescent lighting here is dimmed further, encouraging rest.
~
#EXIT
Direction east~
ToRoom    40704
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    40708
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 40704 2 40706
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40707
Name     Naro and Calleh's Chamber~
Sector   underwater~
Flags    ~
Desc     A modest shared chamber, kept simple by two people who spend
most of their waking hours elsewhere in the Temple regardless. A
single shared desk holds notes in two very different handwritings.
~
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    40704
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 40701 1 40707
Reset M 0 40702 1 40707
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40708
Name     Coral Meditation Garden~
Sector   underwater~
Flags    ~
Desc     Living coral grows in careful, cultivated patterns throughout
this quiet garden, sheltering small luminous fish that drift between
the branches. Healers and patients alike come here to simply sit and
breathe.
~
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    40706
#ENDEXIT
#ENDROOM

